CLAUDE.local.md

# Python: local environments, the editable-install extension, test caches.
.venv/
.venv-nopyx12/
crates/oxedi_py/python/oxedi/*.so
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# DuckDB extension artifacts copied to the root for DuckDB's CI.
/build/
# Documentation site: its environment and the build output.
.venv-docs/
/site/

# Browser viewer: the generated module and its glue (make wasm).
/viewer/pkg/

# UI package: installed dependencies and build output (sandbox runs write here).
/ui/node_modules
/ui/dist
